## 🎯 Bonus Challenge

The program also calculates the year in which the user will turn 60.

The calculation is:

```python
year = 2026
turn60 = year + (60 - age)
```

For example, if the user is **22 years old**:

```text
2026 + (60 - 22) = 2064
```

So the user will turn 60 in **2064**.

